     "text": "High in the troposphere, invisible ribbons surge with colossal torrents of equatorial ocean vapor. These swift atmospheric rivers traverse continents unseen, carrying boundless moisture aloft until coastal summits force their vaporous cargo to condense, unleashing furious deluges upon the waiting ea"
